      "kind": "constellation",
      "constellation": 5,
      "unlock": "constellation"
    },
    {
      "key": "c6",
      "name": "Lupus Fulguris",
      "description": "Every 10s, Razor's sword charges up, causing the next Normal Attack to release lightning that deals 100% of Razor's ATK as Electro DMG.\nWhen Razor is not using Lightning Fang, a lightning strike on an opponent will grant Razor an Electro Sigil for Claw and Thunder.",
